{"title":"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be a point in triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/1/7c1c5489a832d1fba1b0c0b925f97530d6091d46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AMC=90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"108\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/3/3b30238d073239e8c392082376a76633ebd73fc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AMB=150^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"118\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/7/fe7b5ca66bc7e2b1fdc6b77f4d88d0e0af25fc20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BMC=120^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"118\" height=\"13\" />. The centers of circumcircles of triangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71b0b26d295a2b6379ca4d0ee45dacd21cdd3122.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AMC,AMB,BMC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"159\" height=\"16\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/f/3efd92d7eef6e4b04b61b6ff7e353462a2607585.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P,Q,R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" />, respectively. Prove that the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/a/b4a455d533200d7dfbd00731fa8bd9e8796fb803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PQR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is greater than the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the above constraints, we can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62e6c71996e6eed72b0a8bd03c70644f04bcdbe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,2c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e8956fb40a7eee60c32534f42869f179ab4d1695.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-2a,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/0/2a054c082cfdef9167e25f100651def717e72b30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2b\\sqrt{3},-2b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"21\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> are positive.  Note that the centers of circumcircles are on the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perpendicular_bisector\" title=\"Perpendicular bisector\">perpendicular bisectors</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e73bc78b745edf7fe1e55dbfc3d914190faf5015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/6/8068607716f3c2549af1dc978d77a422ca7201dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BM$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa38fd42cdaa5db0dd4e0f7df98ae79a598eb627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63fc90a0824900ea770e03a36fae1f83abe9f8cc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import graph; size(9.22 cm); real lsf=0.5; pen dps=linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10); defaultpen(dps); pen ds=black; real xmin=-24.2,xmax=24.2,ymin=-24.2,ymax=24.2;  pen cqcqcq=rgb(0.75,0.75,0.75), evevff=rgb(0.9,0.9,1), zzttqq=rgb(0.6,0.2,0);   /*grid*/ pen gs=linewidth(0.7)+cqcqcq+linetype(&quot;2 2&quot;); real gx=4,gy=4; for(real i=ceil(xmin/gx)*gx;i&lt;=floor(xmax/gx)*gx;i+=gx) draw((i,ymin)--(i,ymax),gs); for(real i=ceil(ymin/gy)*gy;i&lt;=floor(ymax/gy)*gy;i+=gy) draw((xmin,i)--(xmax,i),gs);  Label laxis; laxis.p=fontsize(10);  clip((xmin,ymin)--(xmin,ymax)--(xmax,ymax)--(xmax,ymin)--cycle);  draw((-24,0)--(24,0),Arrows); draw((0,24)--(0,-24),Arrows);  pair M=(0,0),A=(-16,0),C=(0,10),B=(6.928,-4),P=(-8,5),R=(7.506,5),Q=(-8,-21.856); dot(M); label(&quot;$(0,0)$&quot;,M,NW); draw(A--B--C--A); dot(A); label(&quot;$(0,2c)$&quot;,C,N); dot(B); label(&quot;$(2b\\sqrt{3},-2b)$&quot;,B,SE); dot(C); label(&quot;$(-2a,0)$&quot;,A,SW); draw(A--M,dotted); draw(B--M,dotted); draw(C--M,dotted);  dot(P); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,P,NW); dot(Q); label(&quot;$Q$&quot;,Q,S); dot(R); label(&quot;$R$&quot;,R,NE); draw(P--Q--R--P,dotted); [/asy]\" width=\"435\" height=\"438\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/01927bf7bbcf5688067a91087d440c77879049b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AMC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> is a right triangle, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Circumcenter\" title=\"Circumcenter\">circumcenter</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/3431b35dcd263cac56e5c8a8aed399ba0ce6fce2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AMC$\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" /> is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Midpoint\" title=\"Midpoint\">midpoint</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, so the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8fa5db1c5ada649954382305e1d59b5da27701a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-a,c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />.  Additionally, the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/856c130e0bb237c3edeb7e3c0246d40cc607e861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MB$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/5/d252d4d511d1b8b88fac38027a63893fca86e3da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b\\sqrt{3},-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"21\" /> and the slope of line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/856c130e0bb237c3edeb7e3c0246d40cc607e861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MB$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> on the coordinate grid is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/e/b5e72e8d1d9831e4f16d2e426241475421448270.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\tfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" />.  Therefore, the equation of the perpendicular bisector of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/856c130e0bb237c3edeb7e3c0246d40cc607e861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MB$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb66ceff7cd32ff77d92561816b61e9a64874849.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + b = \\sqrt{3} (x - b\\sqrt{3})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"165\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on the perpendicular bisector of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e73bc78b745edf7fe1e55dbfc3d914190faf5015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />, so the y-coordinate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />.  Therefore, the x-coordinate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e2664c0a0797ba1646bb7c9870df7d33e931407.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}c + \\tfrac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"87\" height=\"24\" />.  Thus, the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec6916b50feec24773d374eaada26a95bcabc6fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PR$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c2ea35dcb6b83e64fb9c227882418e07dd9f726.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}c + \\tfrac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}b + a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"119\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNow we'll calculate the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/a/b4a455d533200d7dfbd00731fa8bd9e8796fb803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PQR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />.  By using a triangle area formula,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/9/f790e869e1fcf5ba8202da9e6c1433eeaf11dcfb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} [ABC] &amp;= \\frac12 \\cdot 2a \\cdot 2c + \\frac12 \\cdot 2c \\cdot 4b \\cdot \\frac12 + \\frac12 \\cdot 2a \\cdot 4b \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\ &amp;= 2ac + 2bc + 2ab\\sqrt{3}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"408\" height=\"66\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/a/b4a455d533200d7dfbd00731fa8bd9e8796fb803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PQR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is a 30-60-90 triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/c/10c56ddda3ba245916ce01cb482235e344fed18e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ = c + 4b + a\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"23\" />.  Therefore,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/1/cc18e06e70585b00b6b3673d1a1988789a1ac9e2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} [PQR] &amp;= \\frac12 \\cdot (\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}c + \\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}b + a) \\cdot (c + 4b + a\\sqrt{3}) \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\cdot (\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}c + \\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}b + a)^2 \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\cdot (\\frac13 c^2  + \\frac{16}{3} b^2 + a^2 + \\frac83 bc + \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}ac + \\frac{8\\sqrt{3}}{3}ab) \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}c^2 + \\frac{8\\sqrt{3}}{3}b^2 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}a^2 + \\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}bc + ac + 4ab. \\end{align*}\" width=\"461\" height=\"184\" />\nNow what's left is to show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3bc69afcf9b092b0eec5c674c9ed17570af909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[PQR] &gt; [ABC]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8eccefd3b2141147b7f6934056f975a86fe99d95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/153b809b7d10fcf33cd4381672a74ded5129f84f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}bc + 4ab &gt; 2bc + 2ab\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"215\" height=\"24\" />.  Additionally, by using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AM-GM_Inequality\" title=\"AM-GM Inequality\">AM-GM Inequality</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/c/cfc8ee77c771efcab07f3b618e12efe5153f1d3b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6} c^2 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} a^2}{2} &amp;\\ge \\sqrt{\\frac14 \\cdot (ac)^2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6} c^2 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} a^2 &amp;\\ge ac \\\\ ac + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6} c^2 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} a^2 &amp;\\ge 2ac. \\end{align*}\" width=\"257\" height=\"141\" />\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/7/887efe8aa4ed6aa358567910c704f2a01f8a6c99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[PQR] &gt; ac + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6} c^2 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} a^2 + \\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}bc + 4ab &gt; [ABC]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"426\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO\">2005 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017205644\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 302/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1044/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11229/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.623      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    6.623      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17780:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017205644 and revision id 110350. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}